// Flattened red_dragon.rs2's [ai_queue3,red_dragon] table.
// npc_param(death_drop) resolves to dragon_bones; dragonhide_red is a
// separate unconditional obj_add - both are real guaranteed drops.
// ~trail_hardcluedrop is a tertiary clue-scroll roll, excluded (separate
// NPC-agnostic system).
